<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1443296224"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:23.173"><div begin="20.383" end="53.073" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="20.383" end="26.850" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.383" end="20.995">我以</span><span begin="20.995" end="21.631">为</span> <span begin="21.777" end="22.070">永</span><span begin="22.070" end="22.681">远</span><span begin="22.681" end="23.945">可以这样</span><span begin="23.945" end="25.138">相</span><span begin="25.138" end="26.850">对</span></p><p begin="29.273" end="36.657" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.273" end="29.890">好几</span><span begin="29.890" end="30.544">回</span> <span begin="30.646" end="31.564">这样</span><span begin="31.564" end="32.869">地想起</span><span begin="32.869" end="33.864">舍不</span><span begin="34.037" end="34.712">得</span><span begin="34.712" end="36.657">睡</span></p><p begin="38.129" end="45.160" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.129" end="38.746">如果</span><span begin="38.746" end="39.347">你</span><span begin="39.347" end="40.588">能给我</span><span begin="40.650" end="41.259">一</span><span begin="41.259" end="42.030">个真诚</span><span begin="42.030" end="42.685">的</span><span begin="42.824" end="43.672">绝</span><span begin="43.672" end="45.160">对</span></p><p begin="46.964" end="53.073" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.964" end="47.610">无所</span><span begin="47.610" end="48.418">谓</span> <span begin="48.504" end="49.645">我什么都</span><span begin="49.645" end="50.672">无所</span><span begin="50.672" end="53.073">谓</span></p></div><div begin="56.124" end="1:17.181" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="56.124" end="1:03.371" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.124" end="56.460">前</span><span begin="56.460" end="58.246">面的路</span> <span begin="58.385" end="58.650">也</span><span begin="58.650" end="59.169">许</span><span begin="59.169" end="1:00.192">真的</span><span begin="1:00.346" end="1:01.748">并不太清</span><span begin="1:01.748" end="1:03.371">楚</span></p><p begin="1:04.872" end="1:11.558" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.872" end="1:06.418">放心的</span><span begin="1:06.418" end="1:07.292">走</span><span begin="1:07.292" end="1:08.113">了以</span><span begin="1:08.113" end="1:08.743">后</span> <span begin="1:08.932" end="1:10.606">也许会觉得辛</span><span begin="1:10.606" end="1:11.558">苦</span></p><p begin="1:11.688" end="1:17.181" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.688" end="1:12.652">也许会</span><span begin="1:12.784" end="1:13.453">想</span><span begin="1:13.453" end="1:14.496">停也停不</span><span begin="1:14.496" end="1:17.181">住</span></p></div><div begin="1:18.025" end="1:37.370" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:18.025" end="1:21.757" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.025" end="1:18.616">天越</span><span begin="1:18.616" end="1:19.122">黑</span> <span begin="1:19.122" end="1:19.512">心</span><span begin="1:19.512" end="1:20.520">越累</span> <span begin="1:20.520" end="1:21.757">我看见</span></p><p begin="1:21.982" end="1:26.731" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.982" end="1:22.284">你</span><span begin="1:22.284" end="1:23.411">的脸</span> <span begin="1:23.628" end="1:24.253">听着</span><span begin="1:24.253" end="1:25.815">你说不出口的</span><span begin="1:25.815" end="1:26.731">誓言</span></p><p begin="1:26.862" end="1:30.556" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.862" end="1:27.524">那一</span><span begin="1:27.524" end="1:28.072">刻</span> <span begin="1:28.072" end="1:28.317">我</span><span begin="1:28.317" end="1:29.411">发现</span> <span begin="1:29.411" end="1:30.556">我有天</span></p><p begin="1:30.827" end="1:37.370" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.827" end="1:32.692">经过你的身边</span> <span begin="1:32.757" end="1:34.120">找不到你的</span><span begin="1:34.120" end="1:34.719">视</span><span begin="1:34.719" end="1:37.370">线</span></p></div><div begin="2:00.253" end="2:33.166" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:00.253" end="2:06.509" itunes:key="L12" tt